[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5343.27, "timestamp": "01:29:03", "text": "RPGタイプのゲーム？私はもっ​​と"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5346.95, "timestamp": "01:29:06", "text": "ストーリーモード。物語、そして物語。うん。しかし"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5351.11, "timestamp": "01:29:11", "text": "原神ではなく、ただ、とても長い話です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5353.27, "timestamp": "01:29:13", "text": "ゲームだよ、男。私は以前、原神をプレイしていました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5354.709, "timestamp": "01:29:14", "text": "2年経って飽きてしまったので"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5357.75, "timestamp": "01:29:17", "text": "壮大なストーリー展開がある。はい。そして"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5359.91, "timestamp": "01:29:19", "text": "それはほとんど同じことです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5361.37, "timestamp": "01:29:21", "text": "もう一度。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5364.39, "timestamp": "01:29:24", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5365.39, "timestamp": "01:29:25", "text": "それ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5374.629, "timestamp": "01:29:34", "text": "私はトゥームレイダーのようなゲームが好きで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5377.43, "timestamp": "01:29:37", "text": "もの。ああ、トゥームレイダーは最高だ。ニース。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5379.99, "timestamp": "01:29:39", "text": "火事だ。アドベンチャータイプのゲーム。はい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5383.35, "timestamp": "01:29:43", "text": "覚悟はできています。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5385.99, "timestamp": "01:29:45", "text": "うん、アドベンチャーゲームは本当に楽しいよね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5391.59, "timestamp": "01:29:51", "text": "うん。記録できることはたくさんあります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5394.79, "timestamp": "01:29:54", "text": "私はたくさんのゲームをプレイしたかったのですが、PC"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5395.875, "timestamp": "01:29:55", "author": "@Firefly__2671", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/3WZYI-EaghtDDKgYu2t7zJHTwPSRX4W_D7oxSVjCm4N7mgl2eaFHhiCQLgRHmcsbmXBdMscg6w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i playing tomb raider rn btw"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5399.669, "timestamp": "01:29:59", "text": "ジャマは「いや、私もそう」って感じだった。"}]